// Development-only account IDs. Replace before mainnet and add the exact
// owner-approved coordinator/custody pair to the approval predicate below.
// Replacing these values alone must NOT authorize an arbitrary mainnet pair.
0 constant uno_development_coordinator
1 constant uno_development_custody

// global-id coordinator-account-id custody-account-id -- approved?
// The mainnet approval list is deliberately EMPTY: no operational identities
// have been approved. Network 1 rejects every pair, including plausible-looking
// nonzero values. Other network IDs permit explicit development identities.
{ rot 1 = { 2drop false } { 2drop true } cond } : uno-genesis-operators-approved?

{ uno-genesis-operators-approved? not
  abort"mainnet coordinator/custody pair is not owner-approved"
} : require-uno-genesis-operators
